  "description": "OTEL traces emitted by the ContextForge gateway (OTLP -> Tempo). Requires OTEL_ENABLE_OBSERVABILITY=true (set automatically by make monitoring-up / TESTING_MONITORING=1 make testing-up).",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 0,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to use",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Traces come from the gateway's OTLP exporter (`service.name=mcp-gateway`, `service.namespace=mcp`, `deployment.environment=docker`).\n\n- Click a trace to open the waterfall; use **Traces to Logs** (Loki, `trace_id`) and **exemplars** (Prometheus) to pivot across signals.\n- TraceQL examples for Explore: `{resource.service.name=\"mcp-gateway\"}` \u00b7 `{name=~\"gateway.tool.*\"}` \u00b7 `{span.http.status_code >= 500}` \u00b7 `{resource.service.name=\"mcp-gateway\" && duration > 500ms}`\n- Spans are retained for 24h (Tempo `block_retention`)."
      },
      "transparent": true
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Recent Traces",
      "description": "Most recent traces for the ContextForge gateway service.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 12,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{resource.service.name=\"mcp-gateway\"}",
          "limit": 50
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "nested"
            },
            "properties": [
